<title>USA: Meditrust Q4 net income rises.</title>
<headline>Meditrust Q4 net income rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEEDHAM HEIGHTS, Mass. 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.68		    $0.65</p>
<p> FFO/shr		     0.77		     0.75</p>
<p> Net			 41,479		   33,158</p>
<p> Revs			67,723		   55,246</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  61,172		   50,741</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $2.66		    $1.82</p>
<p> FFO/shr		     3.01		     2.87</p>
<p> Net			157,976		   86,518</p>
<p> Revs		     254,024		  209,369</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  59,458		   47,563</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Full company name is Meditrust</p>
<p>NOTE: Fiscal 1995 net income includes an extraordinary $0.70</p>
<p>per share loss on prepayment of debt.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
